'''Graffiti '''is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Mystery Box 2]] or through trading.

==Appearance==
Its blade is navy blue with the acronym "MM2" graffitied onto it, hence the name. One "M" is yellow, the other is blue, and the "2" is light green. Behind the acronym are streaks of blue, purple, and yellow. The guard is navy blue, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia==
*This is one of the few knives added alongside the [[Season 1]] update.
